# =============================================
# TOP COMPANIES FOR MBA INTERNSHIPS IN INDIA
# =============================================
# Add company name to search term for targeted search:
#
# Consulting: McKinsey, BCG, Bain, Deloitte, KPMG, EY, PwC, Accenture
# Finance: Goldman Sachs, JP Morgan, Morgan Stanley, ICICI, HDFC, Kotak
# FMCG: HUL, P&G, Nestle, ITC, Britannia, Marico, Dabur
# Tech: Google, Microsoft, Amazon, Flipkart, Paytm, Razorpay
# E-commerce: Amazon, Flipkart, Myntra, Nykaa, Meesho
# Automotive: Tata Motors, Mahindra, Maruti, Hero MotoCorp
# Pharma: Sun Pharma, Cipla, Dr. Reddy's, Lupin
#
# Example: SEARCH_TERM="HUL" MBA marketing intern
